vif?t=1764169525\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926520/extras/7ec9e20b6642423c10ba3f7cf96daa40.webm?t=1764169525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926520/extras/7ec9e20b6642423c10ba3f7cf96daa40.mp4?t=1764169525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926520/extras/a86cd9b1fdc2e646612e15b2b92e9129.poster.avif?t=1764169525\" width=615 height=43 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926520/extras/a86cd9b1fdc2e646612e15b2b92e9129.webm?t=1764169525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catastrophic events may occur during your shifts and you must rise to the occasion. During these extraordinary situations, the number of victims increase exponentially. Methodically examine your patients and triage their care according to the severity of their injuries. You will be confronted by moral dilemmas which will directly impact your patients' chances of survival. You will be responsible for difficult decisions—Try as you might, there will be times you can’t save everyone. Can you handle the pressure? <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926520/extras/4a465eabf7749140a7209aac246c9688.poster.avif?t=1764169525\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926520/extras/4a465eabf7749140a7209aac246c9688.webm?t=1764169525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926520/extras/4a465eabf7749140a7209aac246c9688.mp4?t=1764169525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 3 unique districts and intervene at the scene of the accidents, sometimes major catastrophes, that can occur there</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive ambulances with specific driving styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt the way you drive in heavy and realistic street traffic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >36 different complaints, from simple daily cuts to 3rd degree burns caused by an exploding petrol station</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 medical instruments at your disposal, including a stethoscope and oxygen mask </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedures that are realistic and recorded in a manual </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 game modes: Simulation mode for experienced paramedics or classic mode to guide you through your first shifts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926520/extras/88b8f3ec587016d1a8d88316c5bf5cd9.poster.avif?t=1764169525\" width=614 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926520/extras/88b8f3ec587016d1a8d88316c5bf5cd9.webm?t=1764169525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926520/extras/88b8f3ec587016d1a8d88316c5bf5cd9.mp4?t=1764169525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Dedicate your life to saving others. As soon as you receive the emergency call, speed off to the site of the accident in your ambulance, siren